            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "As Found",
        "text": "🚨 ELON MUSK IN 2011 ON REUSABLE ROCKETS\n\nElon said the key to making humanity multiplanetary is developing a fully and rapidly reusable orbit-class rocket.\n\nHe explained it’s an extremely hard engineering challenge because Earth’s gravity makes it just barely possible. A bit lower and it would be easy. A bit higher and it would be impossible.\n\nFor a long time he wasn’t sure it could be done, but in the year before this talk he became confident it was possible.\n\nSpaceX would try to achieve it. They had a design that worked in simulations, but they knew reality would be the final test. https://x.com/ElonClipsX/status/1879028526747111642/video/1",
