        ],
        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "Many people still misunderstand what Starlink is actually for\n\nStarlink isn’t a replacement.....It’s a lifeline\n\n“Starlink will give access to the internet to people that either don’t have access, or where their access is extremely expensive or very bad”\n\nThat is the part people keep missing\n\nStarlink is not trying to replace fibre or local telecom networks\n\nIt is reaching the people those networks still cannot reach, and who have been left disconnected\n\nAnd for someone in a remote area, that connection means access to education, information, work and opportunities that were never available before\n\nThat is why Starlink matters so much\n https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2013228207496126509/video/1",
        "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2108161433968185733",
        "verified": true,
