      "text": "🇮🇳  Starlink will help the least-served in India  🇮🇳",
      "quote": {
        "author": "nitinmeshram_",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106801233772322817/cr909BDo_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 18:59:17",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-08T10:59:17.000Z",
        "id": "2108150233020461235",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Nitin Meshram",
        "text": ". @Starlink is essential for India, and I hope it will be deployed soon. Its ability to connect directly to devices through satellites could fundamentally expand how internet connectivity is delivered. Also, we need many options, not just to have a choice, but to break the duopoly and ensure fair competition, so that the internet remains not only accessible but also efficient. I request the government to allow it to function in India ASAP.",
        "url": "https://x.com/nitinmeshram_/status/2108150233020461235",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
