      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Starlink will be of great help to areas of India that have bad or no Internet and even no mobile coverage. \n\nNo country has perfect coverage, including America, but Starlink can fill in the coverage gaps for those who most need it.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "nitinmeshram_",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106801233772322817/cr909BDo_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 13:02:30",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-08T05:02:30.000Z",
        "id": "2108060444757774374",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Nitin Meshram",
        "text": "In my village, there has been no mobile network coverage since Independence.\n\nOnce, when I went home, a friend from the Supreme Court, who is now a Senior, sent me birthday wishes. I never received the message because there was no network. After I returned, the friend got angry with me for not even replying to the message. I explained that I had no network, but the friend thought I was lying.",
        "url": "https://x.com/nitinmeshram_/status/2108060444757774374",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
