        "name": "As Found",
        "text": "🚨 ELON MUSK IN 2003 REVEALS SPACEX PLAN\n\nIn a 2003 talk, Elon Musk laid out the exact strategy SpaceX has followed for over 20 years.\n\nHe said they would start with a real, proven market: launching small to medium satellites to generate steady revenue.\n\nFrom there, move into human transportation.\n\nThe long-term goal was always clear: build a super heavy lift rocket, the successor to Saturn V, to enable moon bases and Mars missions.\n\nHe called it the holy grail. https://x.com/Alexs_jame/status/2108025996066594976/video/1",
        "url": "https://x.com/AsFoundX/status/2108077332778942903",
